acorn — vendored as part of Story 1.17 (AI-E1-13 — gate scanners AST migration)

Upstream:    https://github.com/acornjs/acorn
Pinned at:   acorn@8.18.0
Vendored at: 2026-08-12 (Story 1.17)
License:     MIT (text preserved below verbatim from upstream LICENSE)

Re-vendoring guidance: re-run `npm pack acorn@8.18.0` and update the
Pinned-at line above AND the size/format of `acorn.js` (file size +
generated-comment prefix). Bumping the pin (e.g., acorn@8.19.0)
requires a separate Story that re-runs the negative-test battery in
`scripts/_smoke_ast_gates.js` because AST node shapes can change
across minor versions.

This file is used only by the gate scripts (Python shells out to
`node scripts/vendor/ast-walker.js <file> <concern>`). The acorn
runtime is never loaded in a browser — AD-1 (no third-party scripts
on the page) is preserved.

